title: Tomato and Butter Bean Soup
servings: 4

## ingredients
3 tbsp olive oil
1 onion, finely chopped
3 cloves garlic
2-3 tbsp tomato paste
1 (14 oz) can chopped tomatoes
2 cups vegetable stock
1 tsp salt
1/2 tsp black pepper
1/4 cup cream
salt to taste

## method
Warm the oil in a heavy pan and soften the onion without colouring it.
Add the garlic and tomato paste and cook for two minutes.
Add the tomatoes, stock, salt and pepper, then simmer for twenty minutes.
Blend until smooth, stir in the cream, and adjust the seasoning.
